00:03:40.015 --> 00:03:43.135
<v Host>Before a negative, it means almost none.

00:03:43.735 --> 00:03:50.671
<v Slow>今年は、この11年でいちばんの豊作になりました。

00:03:51.472 --> 00:03:54.424
<v Host>This year was the best crop in eleven years.

00:03:55.024 --> 00:03:57.400
<v Vocab>豊作

